<title>PHILIPPINES: Filinvest Land sees 1997 net 2.4 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Filinvest Land sees 1997 net 2.4 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Filinvest Land Inc is expected to post net income of 2.4 billion pesos next year from 1.7 to 1.8 billion pesos this year, Joseph Yap, chief finance officer of the Filinvest group said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
